  "notes": "SessionSifu 3.5.21 reduces unnecessary restore waits by counting post-launch readiness and layout time toward existing pacing intervals, while retaining the shared compositor queue and safety delays. A native animated tray spinner remains visible throughout restoration, with progress in the menu. Update the GNOME integration and log out/in once to load the changes."
}
